Planted UI bugs, one flag each, so that every native check can be proved on the real app.
Apply to a copy of Polymux, never the working tree. Add these flows beside them, then run
argus polymux ui --repo COPY --control REAL_CHECKOUT --changed e2e/flows/fixture-seed-*.js
  fixture-seed-layout.js: // @fixture --verify-fixture --verify-tools --seed-overlap --seed-clip --seed-unlabelled --seed-inert
  fixture-seed-crash.js:  // @fixture --verify-fixture --verify-tools --seed-crash
  fixture-seed-perf.js:   // @fixture --verify-fixture --verify-tools --seed-flash --seed-shift --seed-slow --seed-warning

